§ `Miles-Card Routing — golden L4 reference`

-- Hand-written golden OUTPUT for the dmnmd `--to=l4` transpiler.
-- Source of truth (test INPUT): docs/miles-card-dmn.md — two DMN decision tables.
-- Demonstrates BRANCH (First-hit decision → arm order + OTHERWISE) and the
-- ditto operator `^` (copies the token in the same column on the line above).
--
-- Transpiler mapping, for reference:
--   decision table          -> GIVEN/GIVETH function
--   each rule               -> one BRANCH arm, in table order (hit policy F)
--   `-` (wildcard) column   -> condition omitted from the arm
--   multi-value cell A,B,C   -> membership predicate (ditto-flattened OR-chain)
--   numeric `> 0` / `<= 0`  -> GREATER THAN 0 / AT MOST 0
--   the final `-` catch-all -> OTHERWISE

IMPORT prelude

§§ `Domain`

DECLARE Category IS ONE OF
    `GroceriesPhysical`
    `GroceriesOnline`
    `foodpanda`
    `Shopee`
    `OtherOnline`
    `Dining`
    `ContactlessTap`
    `SimplyGo`
    `TeslaCharging`
    `RideHailing`
    `Streaming`
    `FastFood`
    `MYR`
    `StarHub`
    `Other`

DECLARE PaymentMethod IS ONE OF
    `Online`
    `MobileWallet`
    `PhysicalContactless`
    `Amaze`

DECLARE Card IS ONE OF
    `DBS yuu`
    `PAssion Debit`
    `Woman's World`
    `HSBC Revolution`
    `UOB Preferred`
    `Citi Rewards`
    `SC Smart`
    `PRVI`

DECLARE Recommendation HAS
    card IS A Card
    mpd  IS A STRING

GIVEN theCard IS A Card
      theMpd  IS A STRING
GIVETH A Recommendation
mkRec theCard theMpd MEANS Recommendation WITH
    card IS theCard
    mpd  IS theMpd

§§ `Merchant groups (ditto-flattened membership)`

GIVEN merchant IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is a yuu grocer` merchant MEANS
       merchant EQUALS "Cold Storage"
   OR  ^        ^      "CS Fresh"
   OR  ^        ^      "Jasons"
   OR  ^        ^      "Giant"

GIVEN merchant IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is a streaming service` merchant MEANS
       merchant EQUALS "Netflix"
   OR  ^        ^      "Disney+"
   OR  ^        ^      "Spotify"
   OR  ^        ^      "Viu"

GIVEN merchant IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is a fast food chain` merchant MEANS
       merchant EQUALS "McDonald's"
   OR  ^        ^      "KFC"
   OR  ^        ^      "Starbucks"
   OR  ^        ^      "Ya Kun"

§§ `Category groups (ditto-flattened membership)`

GIVEN category IS A Category
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is yuu eligible` category MEANS
       category EQUALS `GroceriesPhysical`
   OR  ^        ^      `foodpanda`
   OR  ^        ^      `SimplyGo`
   OR  ^        ^      `TeslaCharging`

GIVEN category IS A Category
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is yuu food` category MEANS
       category EQUALS `GroceriesPhysical`
   OR  ^        ^      `foodpanda`

GIVEN category IS A Category
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is online four-mpd` category MEANS
       category EQUALS `GroceriesOnline`
   OR  ^        ^      `Shopee`
   OR  ^        ^      `OtherOnline`
   OR  ^        ^      `StarHub`

GIVEN category IS A Category
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is dining or ride` category MEANS
       category EQUALS `Dining`
   OR  ^        ^      `RideHailing`

GIVEN category IS A Category
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is streaming or fast food` category MEANS
       category EQUALS `Streaming`
   OR  ^        ^      `FastFood`

GIVEN paymentMethod IS A PaymentMethod
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is wallet or online` paymentMethod MEANS
       paymentMethod EQUALS `Online`
   OR  ^             ^      `MobileWallet`

§§ `Categorize  (DMN First-hit → BRANCH; ditto on the merchant runs)`

GIVEN merchant IS A STRING
      mcc      IS A NUMBER
      channel  IS A STRING
      currency IS A STRING
GIVETH A Category
`categorize` merchant mcc channel currency MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF   currency EQUALS "MYR"                                    THEN `MYR`
    IF   `is a yuu grocer` merchant  AND  channel EQUALS "inPerson"
                                                                 THEN `GroceriesPhysical`
    IF   merchant EQUALS "foodpanda"                              THEN `foodpanda`
    IF   ^        ^      "Charge+"                                THEN `TeslaCharging`
    IF   ^        ^      "SimplyGo"                               THEN `SimplyGo`
    IF   mcc EQUALS 4111  OR  mcc EQUALS 4112                     THEN `SimplyGo`
    IF   `is a streaming service` merchant                        THEN `Streaming`
    IF   (mcc EQUALS 4899 OR mcc EQUALS 5815)  AND  channel EQUALS "online"
                                                                 THEN `Streaming`
    IF   `is a fast food chain` merchant                          THEN `FastFood`
    IF   mcc EQUALS 5814                                          THEN `FastFood`
    IF   mcc EQUALS 5812  OR  mcc EQUALS 5813                     THEN `Dining`
    IF   mcc EQUALS 4121                                          THEN `RideHailing`
    IF   merchant EQUALS "RedMart"                                THEN `GroceriesOnline`
    IF   mcc EQUALS 5411  AND  channel EQUALS "online"            THEN `GroceriesOnline`
    IF   merchant EQUALS "Shopee"                                 THEN `Shopee`
    IF   ^        ^      "StarHub"                                THEN `StarHub`
    IF   channel EQUALS "online"                                  THEN `OtherOnline`
    IF   (mcc EQUALS 5311 OR mcc EQUALS 5411 OR mcc EQUALS 5611 OR mcc EQUALS 5651)  AND  channel EQUALS "inPerson"
                                                                 THEN `ContactlessTap`
    OTHERWISE `Other`

§§ `CardToUse  (DMN First-hit → BRANCH)`

GIVEN category         IS A Category
      paymentMethod    IS A PaymentMethod
      yuuRemaining     IS A NUMBER
      passionRemaining IS A NUMBER
      fourMpdRemaining IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Recommendation
`card to use` category paymentMethod yuuRemaining passionRemaining fourMpdRemaining MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF   `is yuu eligible` category  AND  yuuRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `DBS yuu` "10"
    IF   `is yuu eligible` category  AND  yuuRemaining AT MOST 0
                                     AND  passionRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `PAssion Debit` "5"
    IF   `is yuu food` category      AND  `is wallet or online` paymentMethod
                                     AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `Woman's World` "4"
    IF   category EQUALS `SimplyGo`
         THEN mkRec `SC Smart` "6% cb"
    IF   `is yuu food` category  OR  category EQUALS `TeslaCharging`
         THEN mkRec `PRVI` "1.4"
    IF   `is online four-mpd` category  AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `Woman's World` "4"
    IF   `is dining or ride` category   AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `HSBC Revolution` "4"
    IF   category EQUALS `ContactlessTap`  AND  paymentMethod EQUALS `MobileWallet`
                                           AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `UOB Preferred` "4"
    IF   category EQUALS `ContactlessTap`  AND  paymentMethod EQUALS `PhysicalContactless`
                                           AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `HSBC Revolution` "4"
    IF   category EQUALS `ContactlessTap`  AND  paymentMethod EQUALS `Amaze`
                                           AND  fourMpdRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `Citi Rewards` "4"
    IF   `is streaming or fast food` category
         THEN mkRec `SC Smart` "6% cb"
    IF   category EQUALS `MYR`  AND  passionRemaining GREATER THAN 0
         THEN mkRec `PAssion Debit` "~4.5"
    IF   category EQUALS `MYR`  AND  passionRemaining AT MOST 0
         THEN mkRec `PRVI` "2.4"
    IF   category EQUALS `Other`
         THEN mkRec `PRVI` "1.4 / 2.4"
    OTHERWISE mkRec `PRVI` "1.4"

§§ `Tests`

#EVAL `categorize` "Cold Storage" 5411 "inPerson" "SGD"
#ASSERT (`categorize` "Cold Storage" 5411 "inPerson" "SGD") EQUALS `GroceriesPhysical`
#ASSERT (`categorize` "foodpanda"    0    "online"   "SGD") EQUALS `foodpanda`
#ASSERT (`categorize` "Anyone"       4121 "inPerson" "SGD") EQUALS `RideHailing`
#ASSERT (`categorize` "Anyone"       0    "inPerson" "MYR") EQUALS `MYR`

-- yuu pool has room → DBS yuu at 10
#ASSERT (`card to use` `GroceriesPhysical` `MobileWallet` 800 500 1000)'s card EQUALS `DBS yuu`
-- yuu spent, passion has room → PAssion at 5
#ASSERT (`card to use` `GroceriesPhysical` `MobileWallet` 0 500 1000)'s card EQUALS `PAssion Debit`
-- yuu + passion spent, wallet, 4-mpd room → Woman's World
#ASSERT (`card to use` `GroceriesPhysical` `MobileWallet` 0 0 1000)'s card EQUALS `Woman's World`
-- physical-contactless grocery overflow → PRVI (no in-person 4-mpd earner)
#ASSERT (`card to use` `GroceriesPhysical` `PhysicalContactless` 0 0 1000)'s card EQUALS `PRVI`
-- in-person tap resolves by rail
#ASSERT (`card to use` `ContactlessTap` `MobileWallet`        0 0 1000)'s card EQUALS `UOB Preferred`
#ASSERT (`card to use` `ContactlessTap` `PhysicalContactless` 0 0 1000)'s card EQUALS `HSBC Revolution`
#ASSERT (`card to use` `ContactlessTap` `Amaze`               0 0 1000)'s card EQUALS `Citi Rewards`
-- streaming → SC Smart regardless of meters
#ASSERT (`card to use` `Streaming` `Online` 0 0 0)'s card EQUALS `SC Smart`
